              "mapper": {
                "select": "map",
                "folderId": "{{2.CLIPS_FOLDER_ID}}",
                "filename": "AI-Dad-clip-{{formatDate(now; \"YYYY-MM-DD-HHmm\"; \"America/New_York\")}}.mp4",
                "data": "{{41.data}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 1500,
                  "y": 200,
                  "name": "Save clip → 'AI Dad Happy Dad - Clips (auto)'"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 44,
              "module": "anthropic-claude:simpleTextPrompt",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
                "max_tokens": 1200,
                "textPrompt": "You write social captions for the TikTok and Instagram account \"AI Dad Healthy Dad\" (@aidadhealthydad). It is run by Marcus, a dad with late-diagnosed ADHD who uses AI as an external brain and films raw, unpolished videos. Below is the transcript of a short vertical clip that is about to be posted. Write the two captions.\n\nVOICE\n- Genuine, unpolished excitement and conviction: \"I need to tell you about this\" energy. Never salesy, never polished marketing copy.\n- Dry, deadpan humour is welcome.\n- Embrace ADHD, never apologise for it. Never frame ADHD as broken or a flaw. Never use \"you're not broken\" style lines or recovery cliches.\n- Sound like Marcus talking, not a brand.\n\nHARD RULES\n- Never mention alcohol, drinking, sobriety, or any specific habit. The most you may say is \"patterns\" or \"habits\" in general.\n- Never invent facts, stats, trends or story details that are not in the transcript.\n- No em-dashes. At most 2 emojis per caption, zero is fine.\n- Never write a hook that says \"hey guys, today we are talking about\".\n\nTIKTOK CAPTION\n- Short and punchy, max 100 characters, 0 to 3 hashtags. The video does the work, not the text.\n\nINSTAGRAM CAPTION\n- 2 to 4 short lines (max about 300 characters before hashtags) that add one extra thought or ask one question, then a blank line, then 5 to 10 hashtags.\n- Start from these hashtag hints and keep only the ones that fit this clip: {{2.IG_HASHTAG_HINTS}}\n\nOUTPUT\nReturn ONLY a raw JSON object, no code fences, no commentary, exactly this shape:\n{\"tiktok_caption\": \"...\", \"instagram_caption\": \"...\"}\nUse \\n for line breaks inside the strings.\n\nTRANSCRIPT\n{{40.data}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 2100,
                  "y": 200,
                  "name": "Claude: TikTok + Instagram captions (CLAUDE.md rules)"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 45,
              "module": "json:ParseJSON",
              "version": 1,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "json": "{{trim(replace(replace(44.result; \"```json\"; \"\"); \"```\"; \"\"))}}"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 2400,
                  "y": 200,
                  "name": "Parse captions JSON"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": 55,
              "module": "builtin:BasicRouter",
              "version": 1,
              "mapper": null,
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 2700,
                  "y": 200
                }
              },
              "routes": [
                {
                  "flow": [
                    {
                      "id": 43,
                      "module": "google-drive:shareAFileFolder",
                      "version": 4,
                      "parameters": {
                        "__IMTCONN__": 11845960
                      },
                      "mapper": {
                        "destination": "drive",
                        "select": "file",
                        "file": "{{42.id}}",
                        "role": "reader",
                        "type": "anyone",
                        "allowFileDiscovery": false
                      },
                      "metadata": {
                        "designer": {
                          "x": 2700,
                          "y": 0,
                          "name": "Link-share clip (viewer) – only when Metricool is ON (Metricool needs a fetchable URL)"
                        }
                      },
                      "filter": {
                        "name": "Metricool ON – schedule posts",
                        "conditions": [
                          [
                            {
                              "a": "{{2.METRICOOL_ENABLED}}",
                              "o": "text:equal",
                              "b": "true"
                            }
                          ]
                        ]
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": 46,
                      "module": "json:TransformToJSON",
                      "version": 1,
                      "parameters": {},
                      "mapper": {
                        "object": {
                          "autoPublish": "{{2.METRICOOL_AUTO_PUBLISH}}",
                          "draft": false,
                          "hasNotReadNotes": false,
                          "shortener": false,
                          "firstCommentText": "",
                          "descendants": [],
                          "mediaAltText": [],
                          "smartLinkData": {
                            "ids": []
                          },
                          "providers": [
                            {
                              "network": "tiktok"
                            }
                          ],
                          "publicationDate": {
                            "dateTime": "{{formatDate(addDays(now; 2.TIKTOK_DAY_OFFSET); \"YYYY-MM-DD\"; 2.TIMEZONE)}}T{{2.TIKTOK_POST_TIME}}",
                            "timezone": "{{2.TIMEZONE}}"
                          },
                          "text": "{{45.tiktok_caption}}",
                          "media": [
                            "https://drive.usercontent.google.com/download?id={{42.id}}&export=download&confirm=t"
                          ],
                          "tiktokData": {
                            "disableComment": false,
                            "disableDuet": false,
                            "disableStitch": false,
                            "privacyOption": "PUBLIC_TO_EVERYONE",
                            "commercialContentThirdParty": false,
                            "commercialContentOwnBrand": false,
                            "title": "{{45.tiktok_caption}}",
                            "autoAddMusic": false,
                            "photoCoverIndex": 0,
                            "isAigc": false
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "metadata": {
                        "designer": {
                          "x": 3000,
                          "y": -100,
                          "name": "Build Metricool body – TikTok"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "id": 47,
                      "module": "http:ActionSendData",
                      "version": 3,
                      "parameters": {
                        "handleErrors": true,
                        "useNewZLibDeCompress": true
                      },
                      "mapper": {
                        "url": "https://app.metricool.com/api/v2/scheduler/posts",
                        "method": "post",
                        "headers": [
                          {
                            "name": "X-Mc-Auth",
                            "value": "{{2.METRICOOL_USER_TOKEN}}"
